# And when: (v0.2) composes conditions: the block's state is established by its When:
# condition, then by each And when: condition, in order. Its title is "When: A and B".
Screen: Cart
  Background: The user is logged in

  Element: Checkout Button
    When: The cart is empty
    Disable

    When: The cart has items
    And when: The shipping address is set
    And when: A payment method is set
    Enable

    When: The cart has items
    Disable

  Element: Coupon Field
    @wip
    When: The cart has items
    And when: A coupon is applied
    Hide: Coupon input
    Show: Applied coupon
